{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10293200","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10293200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1029320001:1":{"text":"水を汲みに出ただけで、まさかこんなにたくさんの魔物に遭うなんて……","source_cn":"我只是出来取个水，没想到会遇到这么多魔物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DAB0BA2ED28BF82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029320002:1":{"text":"デューラ様、この方々に助けていただいたことに感謝します。","source_cn":"艾雅在上，感激诸位相救。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A9CB459C0240FE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029320003:1":{"text":"よし！修道者も無事に見つかったことだし、聖石盗難事件の調査に戻りましょう！まだ聞かなきゃいけないことがたくさんあるわ！","source_cn":"好啦，既然事情已经顺利解决了，那我们是不是可以继续调查...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D2532EAAA7317BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029320004:1":{"text":"これ以上付き合うなんて言ってねえだろ、お嬢ちゃん！","source_cn":"我可没答应要继续配合你啊，小姑娘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x651FC873570224E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029320005:1":{"text":"諸君、聖石を盗んだ後のことなら、アタランテよりも私のほうが詳しいかもしれない。だが今は修道者たちを無事に聖石町まで送り届けることが最優先だ。","source_cn":"各位，圣石失窃之后的事，比起阿塔兰忒，我或许更为了解。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9C380EDE725D176","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029320006:1":{"text":"その後でも構わないというのであれば……聖石町まで訪ねてきてくれ。","source_cn":"在那之后，如果你们还想要了解这个故事的话……可以来圣石...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC16A761F11E7A77D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029320007:1":{"text":"テミシア、別にこのまま付き合ってやっても――","source_cn":"特弥希娅，其实我可以继续——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x236CA5D60AF0A648","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029320008:1":{"text":"悪いな、アタランテ。自分の口から話したいんだ。","source_cn":"抱歉，阿塔兰忒。在这一点上，我坚持。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA71C233EB33BC505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029320009:1":{"text":"……分かったよ。","source_cn":"……我明白了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABFA82D623652764","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029320010:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>殿、それでは、また聖石町で！","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3F6E98B4694326B6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>殿、それでは、また聖石町で！","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>殿、それでは、また聖石町で！","variant_male_record_index":"117627",